   "why": "RETRIEVE answers ENDDATA: 'CICS RETRIEVE' to the error queue, then 8000-TERMINATION"
  },
  {
   "name": "no-request",
   "why": "the request queue is empty: MQGET 2033 ends the loop at once"
  },
  {
   "name": "one-request",
   "mq_messages": {
    "CARDDEMO.REQUEST.QUEUE": [
